{"_note":"「我的关注」分组标题 + 右侧「管理」入口(整行可点 → /manage)。§2:左名字 13pt/sub,右侧是这一段的操作。文案住 rc.i18n 而不是由 XPage params 传入 —— params 里的字面串没有 locale 维度,传进来就是写死一种语言。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"t","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"4pt","w":"{parent.w}-190pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.title}","fontSize":"13pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"},{"id":"v","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-188pt","y":"4pt","w":"96pt","h":"-1","alignmentH":"2","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${v},0)]${@i18n.uApp}","fontSize":"13pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"},{"id":"a","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-86pt","y":"4pt","w":"86pt","h":"-1","alignmentH":"2","text":"${@i18n.manage}","fontSize":"13pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF","maxLines":"1"}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"title":"我的关注","manage":"管理 ›","uApp":" 个"},"en-US":{"title":"Watchlist","manage":"Manage ›","uApp":""}},"i18nEmptyOk":["uApp"],"_i18nEmptyNote":"英文档量词就是没有:「Watchlist  6  Manage ›」本来就读得通。"}}
